_audit_update_record             
;
2023-05-01 deposited with the CCDC.	2026-11-05 downloaded from the CCDC.
;
_vrf_THETM01_BS_ac249            
;
PROBLEM: The value of sine(theta_max)/wavelength is less than 0.550
            Calculated sin(theta_max)/wavelength =    0.5471
RESPONSE: Even though crystal data was collected up to 0.73 \%A
resolution, the crystal (the largest available) still diffracted quite weakly at
high angle. On repeated recrystallisation we could get only small sized, and
 poor quality crystals. 
;
_vrf_PLAT375_BS_ac249            
;
PROBLEM: Strange C-O-H Geometry (C-O  >   1.45 Ang) .....  O5 Check
RESPONSE: Hydroxyl O (O5) is associated with hight degree of thermal
disorder. 
;
_vrf_PLAT415_BS_ac249            
;
PROBLEM: Short Inter D-H..H-X   H4B  ..H14A  .   1.77 Ang.  
               -x,1/2+y,1-z  =      2_556 Check
RESPONSE: It is difficult to locate hydrogen atoms accurately using X-ray data
partcularly when heavy metal atoms are present. Therefore methods are adopted 
to add hydrogen atoms in coordinated or lattice water molecules, including 
DIF-Fourier maps and DFIX/DANG instructions. H4A & H4B are added using riding 
model whereas H14 are fixed using AFIX13 command. 
;

